<title>JAPAN: Indonesia raises Jan Minas to $24.13--traders.</title>
<headline>Indonesia raises Jan Minas to $24.13--traders.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The price of Indonesia's main Minas crude oil for January lifting was calculated at $24.13 per barrel, up $1.02 from December, traders said on Friday.  </p>
<p>Prices of other grades are as follows:</p>
<p> TYPE		     JAN	     DEC</p>
<p> Ardjuna		  24.10	   23.13</p>
<p> Arun Condensate	23.83	   23.02</p>
<p> Attaka		   24.91	   23.94</p>
<p> Cinta		    23.35	   22.37</p>
<p> Duri		     22.47	   21.56</p>
<p> Handil		   23.76	   22.84</p>
<p> Lalang		   23.85	   22.98</p>
<p> Widuri		   23.28	   22.30</p>
<p> Belida		   24.99	   23.88</p>
<p> Anoa		     25.31	   24.34</p>
<p> Badak		    24.91	   23.34</p>
<p> Bekapai		  24.91	   23.94</p>
<p> Bunyu		    23.83	   22.81</p>
<p> Jatibarang	     23.12	   22.10</p>
<p> Bontang Mix	    23.63	   22.82</p>
<p> Walio		    23.93	   22.91</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Energy Desk +81-3-5473-3708</p>
